{"seq":3,"slug":"custom-uri-scheme","title":"自定义 URI Scheme","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mobile/mobile-deep-linking/fundamentals/custom-uri-scheme","wordCount":877,"readingTime":4,"html":"<h1 id=\"自定义-uri-scheme\">自定义 URI Scheme</h1><p>自定义 URI Scheme 是移动深链最早的方案，至今仍是 App 间通信、系统级跳转的重要工具。与 Universal Links 和 App Links 相比，它的优势是零服务器依赖、全版本兼容，代价是缺乏安全验证机制，需要开发者自行防范劫持与注入攻击。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><ul>\n<li><strong>Scheme 注册</strong>：iOS 通过 <code>Info.plist</code> 的 <code>CFBundleURLSchemes</code>，Android 通过 <code>AndroidManifest.xml</code> 的 <code>intent-filter</code> 声明对某协议的处理能力，操作系统收到对应 URL 时路由给该 App</li>\n<li><strong>无验证机制</strong>：任何 App 都可以注册相同的 Scheme，存在劫持风险，iOS 无法阻止，需要通过参数签名或来源白名单自行防护</li>\n<li><strong>SceneDelegate vs AppDelegate</strong>：iOS 13+ 需要同时在 <code>UIApplicationDelegate</code> 和 <code>UIWindowSceneDelegate</code> 处理 URL，<code>onOpenURL</code> 是 SwiftUI 的统一入口</li>\n<li><strong>onNewIntent 陷阱</strong>：Android 的 <code>singleTask</code> Activity 在 App 已运行时收到新深链只触发 <code>onNewIntent</code>，遗漏此方法会导致 App 在前台时深链失效</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"uri-scheme-的结构\">URI Scheme 的结构</h2><p>一个完整的自定义 URI Scheme 链接遵循 RFC 3986 URI 规范：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"myapp://category/product/detail?id=12345&amp;source=push&amp;token=abc&#10;  ^---^   ^----^  ^------^  ^---^  ^--------------------------^&#10;  scheme   host    path                   query string\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>myapp://category/product/detail?id=12345&#x26;source=push&#x26;token=abc</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  ^---^   ^----^  ^------^  ^---^  ^--------------------------^</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  scheme   host    path                   query string</span></span></code></pre></div><p>各部分的设计建议：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>部分</th>\n<th>建议</th>\n<th>原因</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>scheme</td>\n<td>全小写、唯一前缀（如 <code>com.example.app</code>）</td>\n<td>避免与其他 App 冲突</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>host</td>\n<td>描述功能模块（<code>product</code>、<code>user</code>、<code>payment</code>）</td>\n<td>便于路由分发</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>path</td>\n<td>RESTful 风格，层级清晰</td>\n<td>与网页 URL 对应，降低维护成本</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>query</td>\n<td>仅传递必要参数，避免敏感数据</td>\n<td>URI 可能被日志记录</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"ios-注册与处理\">iOS 注册与处理</h2><h3 id=\"info-plist-声明\">Info.plist 声明</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"xml\" data-code=\"&lt;key&gt;CFBundleURLTypes&lt;/key&gt;&#10;&lt;array&gt;&#10;    &lt;dict&gt;&#10;        &lt;key&gt;CFBundleURLName&lt;/key&gt;&#10;        &lt;string&gt;com.example.app&lt;/string&gt;&#10;        &lt;key&gt;CFBundleURLSchemes&lt;/key&gt;&#10;        &lt;array&gt;&#10;            &lt;string&gt;myapp&lt;/string&gt;&#10;        &lt;/array&gt;&#10;    &lt;/dict&gt;&#10;&lt;/array&gt;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">key</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">>CFBundleURLTypes&#x3C;/</span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">key</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">array</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    &#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">dict</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        &#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">key</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">>CFBundleURLName&#x3C;/</span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">key</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        &#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">>com.example.app&#x3C;/</span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        &#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">key</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">>CFBundleURLSchemes&#x3C;/</span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">key</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        &#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">array</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">            &#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">>myapp&#x3C;/</span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        &#x3C;/</span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">array</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    &#x3C;/</span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">dict</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;/</span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">array</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">></span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"appdelegate-处理-uikit\">AppDelegate 处理（UIKit）</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"swift\" data-code=\"func application(_ app: UIApplication,&#10;                 open url: URL,&#10;                 options: [UIApplication.OpenURLOptionsKey: Any] = [:]) -&gt; Bool {&#10;    guard url.scheme == &quot;myapp&quot; else { return false }&#10;    return DeepLinkRouter.shared.handle(url: url)&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">func</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> application</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">_</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> app: UIApplication,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">                 open</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> url: URL,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">                 options</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [UIApplication.OpenURLOptionsKey: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">Any</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">] </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> [</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark